Merhabalar,

Dün ciddi bir satış baskısı gören fiyat ile portföyümdeki GYO ve bankacılık sektöründe olan paritelerden kısmi kâr realizasyonu gerçekleştirdim. Yükseliş trendinin bozulduğunu henüz düşünmüyorum, ancak XU100</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto relative overflow-hidden aspect-video"><div class="grid h-full w-full grid-cols-2 gap-0.5"><div class="row-span-2 overflow-hidden"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2024784927967846807/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="3286" height="1934" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mEwbkAA0Ug0?format=webp&amp;name=small" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mEwbkAA0Ug0?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mEwbkAA0Ug0?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mEwbkAA0Ug0?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 50vw, 300px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/2024784927967846807/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2024784927967846807/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="3286" height="1934" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mpAaYAAkYYw?format=webp&amp;name=small" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mpAaYAAkYYw?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6mpAaYAAkYYw?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HBl6